C|Do not change AgentOutputObserver. It is the reference for correct behaviour here, not a thing to edit.
C|Keep LogFormat.Read's signature and its single-line-per-record contract. A record still yields at most one LogLine.
C|Preserve every existing self-test expectation in tests/FKNRTD.SelfTest/Program.cs around line 3627 and line 6664. In particular {"type":"system","subtype":"init","session_id":"3f9c"} must still read as 'session init' / LogKind.Noise.
C|Only draw glyphs already used in this file. Do not introduce a new marker character; AGENTS.md requires font checks for new glyphs.
C|Add a self-test per fix, in the existing Check(...) style of the hand-rolled harness. No test may start a real agent.
C|TreatWarningsAsErrors is on; the build must be warning-free.
